{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000403","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000403"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000403","label":"仲行（子輿氏）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"仲行","mention_ids":["c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0035"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0035","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p039","quote":"仲行"}],"identity_note":"依本卷特定時代與事件暫定人物；不以同稱、官號或短名全域合併，未見本名不補造。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"仲行","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000403","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p039","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p039","text":"三十九年，繆公卒，葬雍。從死者百七十七人，秦之良臣子輿氏三人名曰奄息、仲行、鍼虎，亦在從死之中。秦人哀之，為作歌黃鳥之詩。君子曰：「秦繆公廣地益國，東服彊晉，西霸戎夷，然不為諸侯盟主，亦宜哉。死而棄民，收其良臣而從死。且先王崩，尚猶遺德垂法，況奪之善人良臣百姓所哀者乎？是以知秦不能復東征也。」繆公子四十人，其太子嵤代立，是為康公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000253","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0025","start":25,"end":30,"surface":"子輿氏三人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"奄息","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000402","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"仲行","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000403","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"鍼虎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000404","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0066","st